@startuml
title SD06 - Pesquisa de Médicos (Paciente)

actor "Paciente" as Patient
participant "PhysicianController" as PhyCtrl
participant "PhysicianRepository" as PhyDB

Patient -> PhyCtrl : GET /physicians/search?query=cardio
activate PhyCtrl

PhyCtrl -> PhyDB : findByNameOrSpecialty(query)
activate PhyDB
PhyDB --> PhyCtrl : List<Physician>
deactivate PhyDB

PhyCtrl -> PhyCtrl : Map to DTO (PhysicianResponse)
note right: Filtra dados sensíveis\n(ex: ID interno, configs)

PhyCtrl --> Patient : 200 OK (Lista JSON)
deactivate PhyCtrl
@enduml